{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828970/extras/0317835696f1abd2119a50b6d9017c0a.poster.avif?t=1768609747\" width=780 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828970/extras/0317835696f1abd2119a50b6d9017c0a.webm?t=1768609747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828970/extras/0317835696f1abd2119a50b6d9017c0a.mp4?t=1768609747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a team of fae girls through 4 missions as they travel to the dreamworld and uncover the secrets of their classmates and face horrific nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong>: Urban fantasy / Horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828970/extras/DescriptionImage_Art.gif?t=1768609747\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artwork, writing and music made by a group of friends without the use of AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828970/extras/d28966794480488d6fb842ec6bb1648c.poster.avif?t=1768609747\" width=780 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828970/extras/d28966794480488d6fb842ec6bb1648c.webm?t=1768609747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828970/extras/d28966794480488d6fb842ec6bb1648c.mp4?t=1768609747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>